nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsGVoyULEeRd1FfbTv30JyFAIJvsVtYMXoulKP90Q2VKg&oe=6999A4D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r4_e3Svv8-QQ7kNvwGWgsBA&_nc_oc=AdmAG5ltY2DKmPLz7C1zXPNAxkyHC4H7UiD5g0q-K5zHKoU9eAE892mERlZtSuU8Y9A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv6bvTHAn_e1g336L3t3KljzHRo7hpunFmSvavDiI1hgw&oe=6999AA15"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p_8Y0XGY7ccQ7kNvwGsba-8&_nc_oc=AdmAA5amZblgmrUbA5POQkntTdIojJFYVWdcE1lpG3eOoKZIDnTsbi8KRISXrko840c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftDnm0FvHEsRmejBN8EHs6LOdQYYrNSsaQKv39WV-_Ryw&oe=6999BDC2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J7izR-o26aUQ7kNvwG3m_9s&_nc_oc=AdkdZ4FUD2ah3rrpMsQllLvl0AA-forlPUhti42JOe7r-EFc8aD9fdLWBABFASonF0Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsBRqoghQMTAuq3Nv6cOn_ffDO1jpSHXluq50BxTVx32Q&oe=6999A444"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2Us4HE1-TzcQ7kNvwHJFT8X&_nc_oc=Adkfr39JdP5Stod4Kz_fSLTAYY_oWTFPH2s_PWi38ER1RF1UE_1-W5irOTJX5HkiKds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftPh7CzFUuSEn5GA7-16yYwWM2fiuqWHGPvggxQOtQ97w&oe=69999CA2"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "874968081049627", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_874968084382960_490444167917392231_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eQEhwfqlLgwQ7kNvwHh0XTy&_nc_oc=Adl9zhbG2BpsFBZacuLVHpzvuyWzbshdBrshv1H0adUZuHFHMtfzBseuywv-b4IjSzg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvwQBdDAkmwyli6ukgWzW7GNPXd9aFvLd